talk 1 lines: ["n_baldino: Twinsen! At last! Mind the... ah. Never mind, I have another one.","n_hero: Baldino, Vesk says the project brings heat and light. What is it really doing?","n_baldino: Look at the globe. Our planet sits inside a shell, like a nut. Beneath the shell sleeps the being Sendell watches over.","n_baldino: Vesk is drilling through the shell. He believes the being is waking and nothing can stop it, so he's saving whoever he can. The rest... he isn't.","n_hero: Then we stop the drill.","n_baldino: No, no, no! Stop it halfway and the shell cracks on its own. We have to go down there and reverse it. But first we need to get past the platform's shield.","n_baldino: That's why I built an override key. Well, almost. Two parts are missing: the cog from the top of the old mill, and the code cylinder in the project depot's locker.","n_baldino: The shield draws power from the three mills. Brake them with your ball, and the shield will be weak enough for the key to open it.","n_baldino: One more thing. Nobody on Citadel Island knows any of this. Zoé is waiting at the lighthouse. When the key is ready, she'll broadcast a warning to the whole island."]
